    {"id": "B08", "brief_lines": [17], "text": "At least two independent implementation precedents and a real failure/fix/regression chain with release scope and evidence limits."},
    {"id": "B09", "brief_lines": [19], "text": "Standalone proposal with source pins, dependencies, unsupported behavior, realistic validation, fact/inference/choice/check separation, opportunity and alternative; no whole-product build."}
